# The VM's own tool pins. Go and the prepulled calico/go-build image come from
# metadata.mk and toolchain/images/go-build, so the VM cannot drift from the
# go-build image. Pinned so two builds of a commit match; bump and re-run
# build-image.sh. Sourced by shell, so keep each line NAME=value.
KIND_VERSION=v0.33.0
# Every k8s version the rig tests against, all pre-pulled, space-separated. The
# first tracks calico's lib/kind DefaultNodeImage. Each adds ~1.5GB to the
# image, so add a version when it is actually tested, not speculatively.
# Digests, not tags: a tag would let the cached node image drift from the one
# kind asks for.
KIND_NODE_IMAGES="kindest/node:v1.33.7@sha256:d26ef333bdb2cbe9862a0f7c3803ecc7b4303d8cea8e814b481b09949d353040"
GH_VERSION=2.99.0
